Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:10.01,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's useless to try and find him myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.74,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll ask the guild to \Nsend out search parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:17.79,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,This knock...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:22.55,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But why isn't he just coming in?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:29.70,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Something must've happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:39.33,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you're alive... \Nthat's all I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.55,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:46.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine... wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:49.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I said wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:52.82,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Let me sleep just a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.47,0:00:57.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll drop a book on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:02.62,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Please don't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.77,0:01:10.56,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt... What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:46.02,Main - Top,Lorraine,0,0,0,,As you know, I study monsters and magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:46.64,Title,Lorraine,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs17\fade(1000,100)\c&H908A88&\3c&H000000&\pos(486.838,280.462)}The Undead\NInfiltrates the Town
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:50.63,Main - Top,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But I've never heard of anyone who got eaten \Nby a dragon and turned into an undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:53.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Is this "dragon" still in the labyrinth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:56.44,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I think it's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:03:01.28,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I believe a word \Nof what you're saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:04.62,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But I don't think I have a choice, \Ngiven the way you look right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:13.89,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even seeing me like this, \Nshe's completely calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:18.45,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's Lorraine for you. Academic, \Nmage, and adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:23.73,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Though it feels like she's viewing me as less \Nof a friend and more of a test subject...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:24.87,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:28.67,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I know this is a cruel thing \Nto say, but are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:33.98,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Are you, now that you're \Nundead, really Rentt Faina?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:43.66,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I have the memories and mind of Rentt Faina.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:46.64,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I definitely died.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:51.57,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Are the current me and the \Nold me the same person?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.90,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:59.35,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That answer seems like exactly \Nwhat I'd expect Rentt to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:02.81,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But it's hard to say if you're \Nreally the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:07.41,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But we'll set that problem aside for \Nthe moment. I'll think about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:11.30,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So, what will you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:15.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want to continue being an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:19.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm going to become mythril, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.53,0:04:25.90,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I can't go to the guild like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:30.05,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So you want me to accept \Njobs for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.05,0:04:32.73,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Oh, you can't use the inn either, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:34.69,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Stay here, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:36.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I appreciate it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:38.98,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:40.92,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:45.12,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But I'm sure you'd feel awkward if \NI offered to let you stay for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:50.10,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So instead, you can help with my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:53.81,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,No one's ever had the chance \Nto study a monster that can
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:55.68,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,use existential evolution directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:58.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You can't dissect me or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.93,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What kind of monster do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:07.46,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, I might ask for some \Nskin and flesh, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:14.24,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:16.84,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Here's the money for the magic stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:21.76,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And this is the money for the slime liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:24.68,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You'll pay this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:29.30,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,If I pay you directly, I can \Ncut out the guild's fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:33.13,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And the materials you bring in \Nare always of high quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:36.07,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,They make for great beauty lotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:38.24,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:41.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm off to the Three-Pronged Spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.67,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The blacksmith?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:44.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.65,0:05:52.36,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Few things in life feel \Nas nice as a heavy purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:05.81,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:11.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sorry I look so... strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.31,0:06:14.76,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,No, don't let it bother you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:17.64,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Come closer. May I ask what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:21.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want a new sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:23.41,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:32.55,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,It seems like you've been \Ntaking good care of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:35.03,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,but it's at the limit of its lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:39.42,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,From the look of the damage, I assume \Nyou either use magic or spirit energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:42.96,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes, I use both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:45.01,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And divinity, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:50.54,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,All of them? That's very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:53.75,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,You're only the second such \Nperson to ever visit our store.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.81,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If you could keep it a secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.24,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:03.77,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,You can't be a blacksmith if you \Ncan't keep your customers' secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:07.01,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Will this be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:14.32,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Yes. We should be able to \Nmake something quite nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:16.87,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Feel free to just pay half for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.52,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,You can pay the remainder \Nwhen you pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:20.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That would be wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.20,0:07:23.94,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,I'm afraid, however,\Nthat the owner, Clope,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:26.54,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,takes a great deal of pride in his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:29.89,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,It will take several days to do the work,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:33.89,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,and he'll probably want to speak with you \Nseveral times throughout the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:36.78,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:42.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,When you want to see me, \Ncontact Lorraine, the academic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:47.51,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:51.43,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,A ghoul... a lesser undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.43,0:07:55.84,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Strong physical abilities, and capable \Nof surviving even decapitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:58.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,They prefer the meat of \Nanimals, particularly humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:01.69,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Mostly found in the labyrinths.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:05.63,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Some theories say they are \Nborn from human corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:11.08,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There are known cases of powerful monsters \Nturning humans into lesser undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:15.31,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But in those cases, the victims not \Nonly lost their personalities,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:18.66,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,they lost any kind of \Nhuman will or emotion...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:27.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt is an extremely special \Ncase. So I can't be sure, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:33.48,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But the chance that he's the exact same \Nbeing he was in life is extremely low.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:36.06,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.90,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,He feels like Rentt to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:42.30,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,He's always...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:48.33,Flashback,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Missy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:51.12,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:55.62,Flashback,Adventurer,0,0,0,,You just took a job that'll send \Nyou to Azul Forest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:59.55,Flashback,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Take him with you as your pack bearer, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:06.67,Flashback,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Nah, you don't have to pay him. \NHe's an iron-class. A rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:08.99,Flashback,Adventurer,0,0,0,,I'd like you to help him \Ngain some experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.57,0:09:18.12,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The leaves look different...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.45,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,This isn't it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.95,0:09:23.84,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Maybe the texts were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:29.87,Flashback_Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The world was such a boring \Nplace to me back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.95,0:09:34.39,Flashback_Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even when I became the youngest person \Nto ever attain the title of Great Doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:35.84,Flashback_Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,it meant nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:43.98,Flashback_Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The title of Great Doctor allows one to \Nregister as a silver-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:50.89,Flashback_Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I went to the frontier nation of Yarlan \Nwithout saying a word to anyone around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:54.91,Flashback_Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Ostensibly, I was there to \Ngather some herbs I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:58.81,Flashback_Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But in fact, I just had \Nnothing better to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:02.95,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:07.53,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You need to harvest the root \Ntoo, or it's less effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:09.13,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I need to be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.51,0:10:19.56,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Hey, pack bearer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:22.15,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Put this in the pack for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.52,0:10:34.01,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't just—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:38.59,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,How did you know how to harvest these?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:50.93,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Use Fortia Polivus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:02.93,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:06.76,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I guess a silver-rank has magic \N on a whole other level...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.76,0:11:09.55,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing special...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:15.78,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:19.64,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Was that your first battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:20.89,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:28.34,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But I always had lots of escorts, \Nor at least people with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:31.18,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:35.09,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,You didn't seem very experienced \Nfor a silver-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:38.60,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,So everyone got worried and \Ntold me to follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:42.38,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:46.44,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You know a lot about herbs, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:51.81,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Someone once told me that if \NI wanted to be an adventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:54.55,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I should learn to read and write,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:58.77,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,and about plants, monsters, \Nand anything else I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:04.43,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't get your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:07.24,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.20,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Rentt Faina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.05,0:12:11.93,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Lorraine Vivie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:14.54,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:16.55,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:20.64,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Could you teach me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.16,0:12:25.86,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,About herbs, and how to fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.86,0:12:29.18,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You knew exactly how to move \Nthrough the forest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:30.97,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There's some trick to it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:34.26,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:38.52,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There's so much I want to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:43.82,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's how things began\Nbetween me and Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:49.44,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,He kept working hard every single \Nday for the next 10 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.36,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,aiming to become mythril-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:56.35,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And I stayed by his side, \Ndoing the research I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:57.97,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That was all I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:13:01.54,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, I did change, a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:06.91,Italics,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I can see, looking back, why the \Nadults were worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:12.17,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I just realized I've been \Nlax about replying to letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:14.64,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I don't want another \Nlecture from the old men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:22.45,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll have to ask Rentt where I put them...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.11,0:13:27.45,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks for making a new sword for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:30.57,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll make sure it's something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:37.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:44.34,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Use this until your sword is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:49.62,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,It can use magic and spirit energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.12,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,Nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:53.53,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:02.89,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,Looks like he's in a good bit of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:06.58,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he come to us for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:09.20,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Are we that untrustworthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:13.94,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that's a curse \Nhe's suffering from.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:19.42,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,It's probably a nasty one. One \Nhe thinks might affect our shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:20.87,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,How awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:23.44,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,He doesn't like to cause \Ntrouble for other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:27.37,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,But still, he said some things that \Nwould help us realize who he is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:31.24,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,He did. That he could use all types of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:33.51,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,and that he was staying with Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:34.97,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.97,0:14:37.76,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,We can make him tell us \Nthe truth eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:41.84,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,It does look like he's going \Nto keep coming to our shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.91,0:14:43.74,Main,Luca,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:46.95,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:49.77,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's been too long since \Nyou've cooked for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:51.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's more if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.19,0:14:53.01,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:56.50,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're not eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.70,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:00.34,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.33,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Good, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:09.34,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, while you were out, I \Nread over all my books again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:13.22,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's clear that you're different \Nfrom an ordinary ghoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:17.75,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's probably got something to do with \Nthe reason you can existential evolve...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:21.52,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What will you become next?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:24.85,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:29.43,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I want to be as close to human as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:31.27,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I guess that's the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:36.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And for that, I'll aim for my \Nnext existential evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:38.95,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Then it's back to the \Nlabyrinth for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.95,0:15:42.92,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll defeat monsters and get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:50.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, I was just thinking that \Nyou really don't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.47,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:13.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:16.65,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:20.57,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Thanks, you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.57,0:16:23.99,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I didn't expect a slime \Nto attack like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:29.81,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I got a little cut. It's \Nnothing bad, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:31.54,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.81,0:16:34.83,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Adventurers are expected to be \Nresponsible for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:37.88,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,If you die in the labyrinth, it's \Nyour fault, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.54,0:16:41.85,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No one is obligated to help \Nan adventurer in a bad spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.61,Main - Top,Lorris,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:43.99,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,There are even awful people out there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.99,0:16:48.29,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,who'll pretend to be in trouble and rob \Nadventurers who come to help them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:49.58,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,though they're rare in Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:51.36,Main - Top,Lorris,0,0,0,,You're strong, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:54.17,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I still always try to save \Nas many as I can, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:57.33,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Please! Let me join your party!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:01.82,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I need... I need the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:06.25,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,As you can see, I just \Nregistered as an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.99,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I can't even fight a slime!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:11.04,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Slimes are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:12.98,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Th-They are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:14.92,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,They're hard for swordsmen to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:17.67,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,So you are a veteran, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.75,0:17:22.97,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I'm a chef. I've got a restaurant in Maalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:28.68,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,But I'm badly in debt, and I need \Nto repay 15 gold by next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:32.64,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I figured I've got no choice but to take \Na chance and become an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:37.08,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I told everybody that I'd do whatever they \Nwanted, as long as they let me in their party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:39.95,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,But nobody would give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:43.83,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,So I came here, since they said you \Ncould go into this labyrinth alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:48.65,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's only if you're \Nactually kind of strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:53.38,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:18:02.97,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'd love to help him, but unless he got \Nreally lucky and found a magic item...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:05.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:08.88,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:11.94,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You can come with me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.94,0:18:14.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I assume you can at least carry a pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:18.11,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Wait! You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:19.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:20.99,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:25.07,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't know if he's a good guy or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.07,0:18:27.75,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,but it won't hurt to try \Nand help someone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:31.30,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I'm pretty strong, you know. \NI'll do whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:37.35,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sometimes I get really scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:38.80,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Am I really me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:43.97,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Are you, now that you're \Nundead, really Rentt Faina?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.25,0:18:47.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This isn't good...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:57.11,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Hey, this is a dead end, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:18:59.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Just follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:09.74,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Huh? There's a corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:12.34,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,The map says it's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:13.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:23.03,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,You're kidding me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:27.76,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,There's a place like this down here in \Nthe Labyrinth of the Moon's Reflection?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:30.55,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No dragon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:50.38,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I figured there'd be a \Nmagic item or two, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:55.33,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Hey, I found a little gap over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:00.43,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,A hidden passage?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.43,0:20:05.47,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Hey, wouldn't we make a fortune \Nif we told the guild about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:11.59,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,N-No, I mean, of course I know \Nyou're the one who found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:13.68,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I just followed you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:17.41,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,There's no way I could take the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.87,0:20:21.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:24.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Tell everyone you found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:28.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But come on ahead with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:41.98,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Damn it! Another empty room?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:44.42,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Let's look for secret passages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:48.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Nobody's come here. There should \Nbe at least a treasure or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:46.26,Main - Top,Rentt,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:53.98,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:55.71,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.73,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,There are no monsters here or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:00.17,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,He can't see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:01.91,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:06.87,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:09.75,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,A teleportation circle...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:14.58,Italics,Lorris,0,0,0,,Step on a teleportation circle and \Nyou'll be sent somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:17.85,Italics,Lorris,0,0,0,,Usually a lower floor filled \Nwith strong monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.85,0:21:19.96,Italics,Lorris,0,0,0,,or some place with deadly traps...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:24.18,Italics,Lorris,0,0,0,,The smart thing to do \Nwould be to abandon him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:26.85,Italics,Lorris,0,0,0,,but if I do that, I'm just \Na monster, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.29,0:21:28.61,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:40.59,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:50.99,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,A giant... skeleton...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.48,0:21:54.42,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,A boss room, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:39.97,Title,Lorris,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs29\c&H2B2C54&\3c&HC5E4F6&\pos(199.652,277.429)}Existential Evolution
